    "main_topic": [
      {
        "h_title": "When to visit Khao Sok",
        "main_title": "When to visit Khao Sok",
        "author": "Khao Sok",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Choosing the right dates for your holiday is always an important element of planning and we’re often asked for advice on when to visit Khao Sok. This is a very difficult question to answer for multiple reasons – the main reason being that Khao Sok weather isn’t as changeable as many other destinations; it’s wonderful at any time of year!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Nonetheless, to give you a bit of guidance we have collected some pointers to help you determine the ideal time for your holiday to Khao Sok.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Khao Sok Opening Hours",
        "main_title": "When to visit Khao Sok",
        "author": "Khao Sok",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "There are two main areas of Khao Sok National Park, the rainforested area which surrounds the visitors’ center, and the scenic area of Cheow Larn Lake. Both areas can only be visited by first passing through the visitors’ center and paying the required entrance fee.",
            "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/cheow-larn-lake/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/cheow-larn-lake/",
                "anchor_text": "Cheow Larn Lake"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "If you’re trying to decide when to visit Khao Sok you’ll be pleased to know that it is open year-round, although access to the park is generally restricted to the hours of 8 am until 5 pm. However, opening hours do vary, which is one of the reasons that we suggest guests take advantage of a recommended tour, allowing them to stay in the park or right next to its borders.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Khao Sok National Park Entrance Fees",
        "main_title": "When to visit Khao Sok",
        "author": "Khao Sok",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Guests to Khao Sok Park are charged an entrance fee that contributes toward the upkeep of the park and ongoing conservation efforts.",
            "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/threats-conservation/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/threats-conservation/",
                "anchor_text": "ongoing conservation efforts"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A reduced rate is available for nationals of Thailand in order to encourage a passion for the natural environment and to make Khao Sok accessible to all of the nation’s citizens.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "When to visit Khao Sok",
        "main_title": "When to visit Khao Sok",
        "author": "Khao Sok",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "If you choose to visit Khao Sok on one of our recommended tours, entrance fee to the park is included within your package price.",
            "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/recommended-tours/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.khaosok.com/recommended-tours/",
                "anchor_text": "recommended tours"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
